<li>The James Weldon Johnson building at Coppin State University is named in his honor.</li>
<li>The James Weldon Johnson Middle School is named in his honor.</li>
<li>Johnson is honored with a feast day on the liturgical calendar of the Episcopal Church (USA) on June 25.</li>
<li>On February 2, 1988, the United States Postal Service issued a 22-cent postage stamp in his honor.</li>
